---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/ui/PageHero.astro';
import { company, contact } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy notice"
  description="How Black Crystal Consulting handles the personal information you share through this website."
>
  <PageHero title="Privacy notice" eyebrow="Legal" size="compact" />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow prose">
      <p class="draft-note">
        This notice describes how this website handles personal information. It is awaiting review by Black
        Crystal and its legal advisers before launch.
      </p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        This website is operated by {company.name}, an environmental and social advisory company registered in
        Zimbabwe (Company Registration No. {company.registrationNumber}) and in South Africa.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        We only collect personal information that you choose to send us through the enquiry form: your name,
        email address, company or organisation, the service you are interested in, your project location and
        your message.
      </p>
      <p>
        The website does not use advertising or analytics trackers and does not set cookies. Like most
        websites, our hosting provider may keep standard server logs (such as IP address, browser type and the
        pages requested) for security and troubleshooting.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use the details you send only to respond to your enquiry and to discuss your project. Your enquiry
        is sent to our team by email. To protect the form from abuse, the server temporarily records the
        network address of each submission in memory to limit repeated submissions; it is not stored with your
        enquiry.
      </p>

      <h2>Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell your personal information or share it with third parties for marketing. It may be
        processed by the email and hosting providers we use to operate this website and to receive your
        enquiry.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        We keep enquiry correspondence only for as long as needed to respond and to manage any resulting
        project, unless a longer period is required by law.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You may ask us to access, correct or delete the personal information you have sent us, subject to
        applicable data-protection laws, including the Cyber and Data Protection Act of Zimbabwe and, where it
        applies, the Protection of Personal Information Act of South Africa.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For any privacy question, email <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .draft-note {
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border: 1px solid #ecd39c;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: #fffaf0;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }
</style>
